     *
     *
     C                   endsr
     *=========================================================================
     *  VALID - Subroutine to attach this form to the policy
     *=========================================================================
     C     valid         begsr
     *
     C                   if        ELprom = 'M'
     *
     C                   move      *on           crtfrm
     *
     C                   endif
     *
